      <title>瑞典首相“AI问政”翻车？全民：我们选的不是ChatGPT！</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aichatgpt-20250805231008716-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 23:10:08 +0800</pubDate>
